## Development-only dependencies

Development dependencies (typescript, tsup, vitest, eslint, prettier and
their transitive dependencies) are not distributed with this package and are
therefore not reproduced here.

## Windows API usage

This package calls documented Win32 APIs at runtime through koffi. No
Microsoft source code or binaries are redistributed.
